# Runtime sequence for one clock cycle

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant TB as Testbench
  participant EX as Executor
  participant TK as Clock
  participant M1 as Module A
  participant M2 as Module B

  TB->>EX: tick_clock()
  EX->>M1: poll_tasks(pre-edge)
  EX->>M2: poll_tasks(pre-edge)
  M1-->>EX: emit / suspend on tick().await
  M2-->>EX: emit / suspend on tick().await
  EX->>TK: advance()
  TK-->>M1: wake waiting task
  TK-->>M2: wake waiting task
  EX->>M1: poll_tasks(post-edge)
  EX->>M2: poll_tasks(post-edge)
  M1-->>EX: resume after tick().await
  M2-->>EX: resume after tick().await
  EX-->>TB: cycle complete
```
